      "verified_extract_apparatus": [
        {
          "literal_text": "P.S. not sent to Darwin The deepness of the sea round Madeira & Po. So. & other Atlantic Islands is against Volcanos being connected with upheaval for the upraising power wd. tend at least to render the sea shallow shd. it fail to push up dry land in the neighbourhood of oceanic volcanos. July 2d—/56",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[2]/div[8]/div[2]/span",
          "source_sha256": "c68a7e09967cfe3752edb6504cacacdca7c8274cece7a8f6fbfad43162838739"
        },
        {
          "literal_text": "Lyell refers to the first diagram given at the beginning of his extract, dated ‘June 1st.’, in his scientific journal (Wilson ed. 1970, p. 111).",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[2]/div[5]/div[2]",
          "source_sha256": "c68a7e09967cfe3752edb6504cacacdca7c8274cece7a8f6fbfad43162838739"
        },
        {
          "literal_text": "Lyell had previously noted the correct depth of 1200 feet in his scientific journal 2, p. 80 (Wilson ed. 1970, p. 110).",
          "dom_locator": "/html/body/div[7]/div/div/div/div/div[2]/div/div[3]/div[1]/div/div[2]/div[4]/div[2]",
          "source_sha256": "c68a7e09967cfe3752edb6504cacacdca7c8274cece7a8f6fbfad43162838739"
        }
